#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/gnome-keyring.xml:30
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>GNOME Keyring</application> package contains a daemon that "
"keeps passwords and other secrets for users."
